From: mcsoda <mcsoda@local>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 01:02:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll: Apple GPTK non-native code regions (CW Hack 23015)

Load libd3dshared via WINE_GPTK_LIBD3DSHARED_PATH, register PE modules with
register_non_native_code_region, and MS-ABI-thunk NT entry points that
D3DMetal calls back into. Ported from gamesir-labs/wine (GameHub).

